  "steps": [
    "Add the peppers, vinegar and garlic to a food processor and pulse to a medium coarse consistency.",
    "In a medium pot over medium heat, combine the honey and the pepper mixture. Bring to a boil and cook until reduced by half. Taste and adjust with vinegar and salt.",
    "Heat the oven to 400F. Season the chicken thighs on both sides, drizzle with oil, and bake 10 to 15 minutes until the skin starts to turn golden.",
    "Spoon the agrodulce over the top and bake another 5 minutes until the sauce is sticky and reduced.",
    "Rest the chicken 5 minutes, then slice.",
    "Whisk all the ranch ingredients together and season.",
    "Toss the slaw ingredients with a drizzle of olive oil, lemon juice, salt and pepper.",
    "Build on Hawaiian rolls: ranch, chicken, extra agrodulce, then slaw."
  ]
